OL,3,GNEWSAEstate's rainwater tanks will help
OL,4,Acombat drought
OL,5,
OL,6,FA National Trust property in one of the
OL,7,Fdriest parts of the country has fitted
OL,8,Frainwater storage tanks to help combat
OL,9,Fproblems with drought and keep its
OL,10,Fgardens in good condition during the
OL,11,Fsummer.
OL,13,FWimpole Estate in Cambridgeshire has 15
OL,14,Fnew tanks and a pumping system in its
OL,15,FWalled Gardens after receiving a
OL,16,Fgovernment grant.
OL,18,FThe introduction will allow the estate
OL,19,Fto save about 5,700 gallons (about
OL,20,F26,000 litres) of water a year.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
