OL,3,GNEWSAEstate's rainwater tanks will help
OL,4,Acombat drought
OL,5,
OL,6,FHead gardener Ciaran Taylor said: "With
OL,7,Fthe new monitoring systems, we can
OL,8,Fcontinually track usage, replenishment
OL,9,Fand safety of the supply."
